# An @code function is imported from the lang module, so it needs @lang;
# the error belongs at the @code line.
# Today: it is reported at 1:1, because the lexer spec keeps no location
# for @code (the check runs during lexer emission).
# error: lexer_code_needs_lang.grammar:12:1:
# error: @code = foo needs @lang
@lexer
tokens
    t, eof, err

# imported from a lang module this grammar does not name
@code = foo
'x'                         → t
.                           → err

@parser
top! = ERR → 1
